In a discussion, James Rising received an email from Hellen Agbevey, a graduate student at the University of Delaware, inquiring about a research assistantship for Fall 2026. Hellen's background includes finance and research interests in sustainable finance and climate change, along with experience in data collection and analysis. James requested a professional and concise email response. The outcome was a reply indicating that there were no available assistantship opportunities and wishing her the best in her search.
